    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f5f8f6898a776bba3f40c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是战斗温温吞吞的，我的灵魂可就要感冒了。\n我的身体，渴望的是让人心潮澎湃的激烈比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e507b115bc02ac8ec9ddcb2aa7cd6372173fd10e6dfc34356198fd9f6f2960",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
