    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272ca71245812357bce1566c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我非常憧憬。\n憧憬三后冠路线的前辈们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "643cbd6be99059bff70cf08f3c4e726844fe01426fa1d4c3179bcb60ded468a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
