    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1fc4366e829ed84e1e445c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……在选择的属于自己，为了自己的道路上，\n留下独一无二且自豪的结果，书写自己的荣光）",
      "source_fingerprint": "20425ae80309ea64ac77d6291ea156e22e96716e796902bbd6b194cf881493e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
