        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1267b0a2487050c594c74138",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许她们不像三冠赛马娘一样，很少创造出一个时代，留下广泛而强烈的震撼，\n并作为世代的代表被人赞颂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c393026e680d695c2918acee4415254d20df1a6ba35601b6850d65a09b8fe1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79efb4e0a74b8599b2c2e4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是后冠赛马娘们，也各自散发着独一无二的魅力，\n然后――让人为之着迷。将魅力传递，并继承下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf96906294f61f83f3bbfd49bc39b5db6774dd004b34e1edafba65a073bc15ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
