      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先，虽然不想打击到她，但我要直率地说出事实。\n告诉她从适性的角度，在2400m的橡树杯上留下结果恐怕很困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91ee0bb4fd0f6be85cfad97f18cda37c8c61cda471ea85eb83bb82d3afabdce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
